{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock-Knock Housekeeping is a psychological horror game where you take role of a housekeeper in a hellish hotel filled with uninvited guests.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Anna, a mother holding onto her life following the death of her daughter. The tradegy mixes with the realities of the every-day routine, and as the story unfolds, Anna beggins to realize her world is no longer the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The rules are simple:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean rooms after guests.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot hunted rooms. If you find yourself inside a hunted room, RUN!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get caught.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric and sometimes psychodelic environments.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct photo-real graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiding and sneaking mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Discord Server for updates:\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037680?t=1767461458","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037680/3a442eaa7ca8d2cc1f8b3dc3fe364a7692757d4e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767461458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037680/b634209dcd5e3744f39eea21d428b7386c5b0552/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767461458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037680/b634209dcd5e3744f39eea21d428b7386c5b0552/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767461458","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subt